Source of truth: `FILTERS.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Read both before evaluating any listing. Check `listings/rejected.md` first.

Hard filters (condensed — FILTERS.md wins on conflict):
- R-BUDGET: asking €80k–159k; above €159k or below €80k excluded immediately. WHITE VARIANT (R-WHITE, updated 2026-11-26): asking ≤€138k, new stock only (commissioned or commissioning by ~31.01.2027), floors 1–10 (floor 1 allowed for white only), area ≥50 m², location restricted (Centru/near-centre, Komsomol lake, Dendrarium area / str. Ion Creangă near the Dendrarium incl. Ion Creangă 5, 5/2, 5/3, near Botanical Garden ~≤1.5 km, bd. Moscova, str. Kiev; elsewhere FAIL); unknown finish = MAYBE with check «уточнить отделку: белый вариант >€138k или вне зоны = FAIL».
- R-BANDS: ONE single price band: €80k–159k inclusive (2026-11-21). QUOTAS: PASS ≤10, MAYBE separate status ≤10 TOTAL (own quota, does NOT consume PASS quota).
- MAYBE PUBLICATION: MAYBE now PUBLISHED with literal tag and specific reasons (e.g. year unverified — must confirm ≥2000). PASS = fully verified; MAYBE = unknown/contradictory but no confirmed violation; FAIL = confirmed violation, excluded. Include all material unknowns, required verification, never fabricate. Unknown year may publish as MAYBE; known <2000 FAIL (unless Stalinka/102).
- R-TYPE/R-AREA/R-LAYOUT: any number of rooms; total area ≥55 m² (known <55 m² = FAIL; unknown = MAYBE); R-PRICE-M2: ≤€2,286/m² for all listings (2026-11-26; price ÷ total area, rounded to the nearest whole euro; was €2,200); own kitchen, bath, hallway, no walk-through rooms.
- R-YEAR / R-EXCL-OLD-STOCK (2026-11-22): OLD HOUSING STOCK EXCLUDED ENTIRELY. ONLY buildings ≥2000 AND commissioned eligible. Any pre-2000 building = FAIL. Any Soviet/typical series = FAIL. Renovation doesn't count. Unverified year with no old-stock indication = MAYBE (must verify ≥2000), never PASS. Pre-2000 exception (Stalinka/102/143/Czech/individual) REVOKED 2026-11-22 20:52 (was allowed 15.11–22.11.2026).
- R-FLOOR: apartments floor ≥2 (second floor and above); no upper limit (2026-11-21); single-storey houses exception. R-TOPFLOOR: top floor flagged.
- R-LIFT: informational only; high floor without lift flagged but NEVER excluded.
- R-MANSARD/R-HOUSE: mansards allowed (flag roof/legal/cadastral); single-storey houses allowed (flag legal/cadastral/land); exception to R-FLOOR/R-LIFT.
- R-EXCL-* / R-WHITE: no hostel/gostinka, soclu/demisol/pe sol, grey variant (white variant allowed with R-WHITE constraints: ≤€138k, new stock, floors 1–10, ≥50 m², restricted location incl. Dendrarium / Ion Creangă near the Dendrarium; add renovation estimate), uncommissioned new build, suburbs (Durlești, Codru, Stăuceni, etc.; no exceptions); ignore promoted 999.md ads.
- R-LOC (2026-11-23): ONLY Centru (whole sector), whole Rîșcani sector EXCEPT Poșta Veche (Poșta Veche excluded; Rîșcanovca, Petricani, Cartierul Moldova/Socoleni, Studenților etc. allowed, but Ceucari and Braniștii blacklisted R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21), whole Botanica sector EXCEPT Malaia Malina and Bolșaia Malina (micro-districts/streets), str. Sarmizegetusa (whole street), and str. Nicolae Titulescu (whole street) blacklisted (R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21/2026-11-23; all other Botanica locations evaluated by standard filters, PASS possible; was entirely excluded 02.11–21.11.2026), and Buiucani near Komsomol lake/Valea Morilor (~0–20 min walk including adjacent Buiucani; explicitly including str. Ion Creangă near the Dendrarium and Ion Creangă 5, 5/2, 5/3, 2026-11-26). EVERYTHING ELSE EXCLUDED: Poșta Veche, other Buiucani, Telecentru, all Ciocana (incl. former Port Mall exception, revoked 2026-11-12), suburbs. Unclear micro-district (e.g. only 'Rîșcani' without street/map) = MAYBE. + R-ALBA-IULIA (2026-11-21): whole str. Alba Iulia in Chișinău (incl. Sculeanca) is location-OK regardless of lake distance, but ALWAYS MAYBE at most (never PASS) with note «Алба Юлия — вне основной зоны (Скулянка/Буюканы)»; suburb Alba Iulia excluded.
- R-MICRO: ≤5–10 min walk to main road, park or university; R-LAKE 20-min priority overrides this.
- R-BLACKLIST / R-BLACKLIST-BUILDING / R-BLACKLIST-AREA (2026-11-25): Streets (13): Drumul Viilor (2026-11-13); Valea Dicescu (2026-11-15); Calea Ieșilor (2026-11-15); Grădinilor (2026-11-15); Pajurii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Pajurii/Păjurii/Пажурий) (2026-11-21 21:00; was in East Rîșcani pocket 2026-11-01 to 2026-11-20, re-blacklisted); Ceucari (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Ceucari/Чеукарь) (2026-11-21 21:09); Braniștii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Braniștii/Branistii/Брэништий/Браништий) (2026-11-21 21:09); Gagarin (Chișinău Centru; variants Iuri Gagarin/Gagarin/Гагарина) (2026-11-21 21:21); Tudor Vladimirescu (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Тудор Владимиреску) (2026-11-21 21:21; re-blacklisted, was removed 2026-11-19); Muncești (Chișinău; variants Мунчешть/Muncesti/Munceşti) (2026-11-22 19:46); Sarmizegetusa (Chișinău Botanica; variants Сармизеджетуса/Сармизегетуса/Sarmisegetusa) (2026-11-23 09:50); Nicolae Titulescu (Chișinău Botanica; variants Николае Титулеску/N. Titulescu) (2026-11-23 09:53); Prigoreni (Chișinău Botanica; all house numbers incl. 5/1; variants Пригорень/Пригорены) (2026-11-25 13:03). Areas (3): Malaia Malina / Bolșaia Malina (Chișinău Botanica; micro-districts and streets; variants Малая Малина/Большая Малина/Malina Mică/Malina Mare) (2026-11-21 23:06; unclear address = MAYBE with map check); Aeroport (Chișinău Botanica; район Аэропорт near Chișinău International Airport; str. Aeroportului, eastern bd. Dacia towards airport roughly from ~Dacia 44/Valea Crucii onwards incl. Dacia 58, 62, any listing labelled Aeroport, any address within ~1.5 km of airport) (2026-11-23 17:34; unclear distance = MAYBE with map check). Buildings (2): bd. Dacia 59 (Chișinău Botanica; complex Edera Home; any apartment in this building) (2026-11-22 21:30; only this building number; Dacia 59/x naming Edera Home = FAIL; unclear = MAYBE with check); bd. Dacia 62 (Chișinău Botanica; all blocks 62, 62/1, 62/A…62/G incl. Grand Family complex; any apartment in this building) (2